+Perfect, this helps a lot 👍
+I’ll **describe and sketch (wireframe-style)** the **two new tabs** so they feel like a **native extension of your existing Bot Builder UI**, not a bolted-on AI toy.
+
+I’ll base this strictly on what’s visible in your OG design:
+
+* Dark theme
+* Rounded cards
+* Tag chips (Breakout, Trend Following, etc.)
+* Search-first interaction
+* “Add / Use” CTA pattern
+* Collapsible code previews
+* Modal + tab hybrid layout
+
+---
+
+# 1. New Tab Overview (Top-level)
+
+You currently have things like:
+
+* Bot Builder
+* Strategy Ideas
+* Indicators
+
+### Add **two new sibling tabs**
+
+```
+[ Bot Builder ] [ Strategy Ideas ] [ Indicators ] [ 🧠 AI Strategy ] [ 📊 AI Results ]
+```
+
+Icons are important here:
+
+* 🧠 = thinking / learning
+* 📊 = output / probabilities
+
+---
+
+# 2. 🧠 AI Strategy (Learning + Analysis Tab)
+
+This tab replaces *searching for indicators* with *asking questions about the market*.
+
+---
+
+## 2.1 Layout (matches OG modal style)
+
+```
+┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│ 🧠 AI Strategy Engine                        │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│ [ Search market idea or setup... ]  (Run AI) │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│  Chips:                                      │
+│  [ Trend ] [ Mean Rev ] [ Breakout ]         │
+│  [ London ] [ NY ] [ Asia ]                  │
+│  [ M5 ] [ M15 ] [ H1 ] [ H4 ]                 │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│  ▾ Market Context (auto-detected)            │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│  ▾ AI Strategy Hypotheses                    │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│  ▾ Learning Feedback                         │
+└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+This mirrors:
+
+> **Strategy Ideas from ProRealCode**
+> but replaces *indicator cards* with *strategy hypotheses*.
+
+---
+
+## 2.2 Market Context Card (Auto, Read-only)
+
+```
+┌──────────────── Market Context ───────────────┐
+│ Symbol: XAGUSD                                 │
+│ Session: London                                │
+│ Volatility: Elevated                           │
+│ Regime: Low Liquidity Fakeout                  │
+│ Structure: M5 Reversal / H1 Range              │
+│ Confidence: ●●●●○                              │
+└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+Design notes:
+
+* Same card styling as indicator cards
+* No buttons (informational)
+* Confidence as dots, not %
+
+---
+
+## 2.3 AI Strategy Hypotheses (Core UI)
+
+This replaces **Ultra Trend Indicator cards**.
+
+```
+┌──────────────── Strategy Hypothesis ──────────┐
+│ 🔹 London Fake Breakdown Reversal              │
+│ Tags: Trend | London | Mean Reversion          │
+│                                                │
+│ Bias: Long (M5) / Neutral (H1)                 │
+│ Rationale:                                    │
+│  - Asia low sweep                              │
+│  - Volume absorption                           │
+│  - Historical match: 78 cases                  │
+│                                                │
+│ [ + Add to Bot ]   [ Use ]   [ View Logic ▾ ]  │
+└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+**Exactly matches** your existing:
+
+* “+ Add”
+* “Use”
+* Expandable preview
+
+---
+
+## 2.4 View Logic (Expandable, like code preview)
+
+```
+▾ View Logic
+-------------------------------------------------
+Entry:
+ - Close crosses above VWAP after liquidity sweep
+
+Risk:
+ - ATR-based stop (1.2x)
+ - Max 2 trades per session
+
+Exit:
+ - Probabilistic target or session end
+-------------------------------------------------
+```
+
+This is **human-readable**, not code yet.
+
+---
+
+## 2.5 Learning Feedback (Auto-learning hook)
+
+This is subtle but powerful.
+
+```
+┌────────────── Learning Feedback ──────────────┐
+│ Similar past setups: 214                       │
+│ Recent performance: ↓ Slight decay             │
+│ Adaptation applied: Wider targets              │
+│                                                │
+│ [ View History ]                               │
+└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+This quietly signals:
+
+> *“The system is learning”*
+> without exposing internals.
+
+---
+
+# 3. 📊 AI Results (Prediction + Probability Tab)
+
+This is where **numbers, curves, and PRT output live**.
+
+---
+
+## 3.1 Layout
+
+```
+┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│ 📊 AI Results                                 │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│ Timeframes: [ M5 ] [ M15 ] [ H1 ] [ H4 ]      │
+│----------------------------------------------│
+│ ▾ Directional Bias                            │
+│ ▾ Price Targets & Probabilities               │
+│ ▾ Probability Curves                          │
+│ ▾ ProRealTime Output                          │
+└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+Same collapsible pattern as OG UI.
+
+---
+
+## 3.2 Directional Bias Card
+
+```
+┌──────────── Directional Bias ─────────────┐
+│ M5   : Long      ●●●●○ (68%)               │
+│ M15  : Long      ●●●○○ (54%)               │
+│ H1   : Neutral   ●●○○○ (42%)               │
+│ H4   : Range     ●●●○○ (57%)               │
+└───────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+No “BUY/SELL” wording — very important psychologically.
+
+---
+
+## 3.3 Price Targets Table (Core Value)
+
+Styled like your parameter tables.
+
+```
+┌────────── Price Targets (M5) ──────────┐
+│ Target        | Probability | Outcome   │
+│-----------------------------------------│
+│ +0.15%        | 62%         | Primary   │
+│ +0.30%        | 41%         | Stretch   │
+│ -0.10%        | 22%         | Risk      │
+└────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+Color coding:
+
+* Green: primary
+* Amber: stretch
+* Red: adverse
+
+---
+
+## 3.4 Probability Curves (Visual)
+
+```
+┌──────────── Probability Curve ────────────┐
+│              /\                            │
+│            /    \                          │
+│         __/        \___                   │
+│        -0.1%   0   +0.3%                  │
+│                                               
+│ Skew: Upside                               │
+│ Confidence: 0.71                           │
+└───────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+Design notes:
+
+* Single clean curve
+* No over-plotting
+* Tooltip on hover later
+
+---
+
+## 3.5 ProRealTime Output (Final Step)
+
+Styled **exactly** like your existing code preview.
+
+```
+┌──────── ProRealTime Strategy Output ───────┐
+│ ▾ Show code preview                        │
+│--------------------------------------------│
+│ DEFPARAM CumulateOrders = False             │
+│                                            │
+│ IF NOT OnMarket THEN                        │
+│  IF Close CROSSES OVER VWAP THEN            │
+│   BUY 1 CONTRACT AT MARKET                 │
+│  ENDIF                                     │
+│ ENDIF                                      │
+│                                            │
+│ SET STOP pLOSS ATR(14) * 1.2                │
+│                                            │
+└────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+│ [ Copy ]  [ Add to Bot ]                    │
+```
+
+No surprises for existing users.
+
+---
+
+# 4. Why this fits your OG design perfectly
+
+* Uses **same mental model** as Strategy Ideas
+* Keeps **Add / Use / Preview** flow
+* No AI buzzwords in UI
+* Probabilities > predictions
+* PRT remains the final authority
+
+This feels like:
+
+> *“Bot Builder grew a brain”*
+> not:
+> *“Bot Builder got an AI bolted on”*
