+
+* ✅ Daily OHLC history
+* ✅ No limits
+* ❌ No intraday
+
+**Use case**
+
+* Backfill data
+* Model training
+* Regime analysis
+
+---
+
+### **3️⃣ Investing.com (Scrape-only fallback)**
+
+Not recommended as primary, but usable.
+
+**Pros**
+
+* Free
+* Near-real-time
+
+**Cons**
+
+* HTML scraping
+* Breaks often
+* Legal gray area
+
+👉 Only use if Yahoo is temporarily down.
+
