+## ❌ What You Are *NOT* Using (by choice)
+
+You explicitly avoid these:
+
+* ❌ Alpha Vantage
+* ❌ Quandl / Nasdaq
+* ❌ Metals APIs
+* ❌ Broker feeds
+* ❌ CME / LBMA
+
+Good call — this keeps the system **open + offline-trainable**.
