+## 🧠 Data Coverage vs Your Auto-Trading Tab
+
+| Requirement           | Yahoo | Stooq |
+| --------------------- | ----- | ----- |
+| Live price            | ✅     | ❌     |
+| OHLC bars             | ✅     | ✅     |
