+## 🔒 Stability & Safety Notes (Important)
+
+Because Yahoo is unofficial:
+
+* Cache aggressively
+* Retry with backoff
+* Never trade tick-by-tick
+* Use **bar-close logic only** (PRT-style)
+
+This actually aligns *perfectly* with ProRealTime’s philosophy.
